From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ned <github@edoardo.fyi>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:17:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 101/108] runtime: bound GS drain to previous vsync
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

iPhone 11 match A/B (3 pairs): FPS 57.737→58.760 (+1.023); frames over 18 ms 18.391%→9.548% (-8.843 pp); drain wait p50 0.265→0 ms. Zero gameplay/startup underruns in 3/3 candidate runs with the audio prime. GPU p95 +0.604 ms and VU1 p95 +0.695 ms were component costs within the 16.7 ms frame budget; end-to-end cadence improved.

